# Build inputs only. Everything the image needs is produced inside it, so
# anything already built locally is excluded — a stale api/wwwroot copied in
# would silently beat the one the frontend stage builds.
.git/
.github/
**/node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
frontend/dist/
api/wwwroot/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
README.md
